ry peru  and in all this time bolsonaro's  popularity as you know  has continued to dwindle what does that  mean for his hold on power and ability  to govern  yeah polls show that brothel sonar is  really under pressure regarding the  elections next year in october 22  ex-president lulada silva is top-ranked  in recent polls he  got back his political rights recently  so he's  uh the candidate to um to win  and uh the opposition that supports him  exactly the people behind me now  protesting in these days  and the protests might go on in the next  month  mathias ebert reporting for us from rio  de janeiro thanks so much
 

